export the data to\\ndesc -- LIST of strings composing each line of the file \
description\\ncols -- LIST of strings containg the header for each data \
column\\ndata -- LIST of arrays containing the data to export\\nOptional \
arguments:\\ncomment -- Symbol to use to indicate non-data lines [default: #]\
